{
 "duration": 26.515,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Marco's first snowy hike started great.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.631
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten minutes in, snow was spilling over the tops of his boots.",
   "start": 3.081,
   "end": 6.35
  },
  {
   "text": "It melted into his socks, and his toes went numb.",
   "start": 6.75,
   "end": 9.479
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Pull leg gaiters on over your laces before you reach the snow.",
   "start": 10.079,
   "end": 14.814
  },
  {
   "text": "The strap runs under your sole,",
   "start": 15.214,
   "end": 16.738
  },
  {
   "text": "the gaiter covers you up to mid-calf,",
   "start": 16.988,
   "end": 18.674
  },
  {
   "text": "and snow slides off instead of falling in.",
   "start": 18.924,
   "end": 21.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Marco finished the loop with dry socks.",
   "start": 21.74,
   "end": 23.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your first snow hike.",
   "start": 24.4,
   "end": 26.315
  }
 ],
